  "title": "CTA – Mørk bakgrunn",
  "content": "<!-- wp:html -->\n<section class=\"section brun-bg\" style=\"position:relative;overflow:hidden;text-align:center\">\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;pointer-events:none;opacity:.18\">\n    <svg width=\"320\" height=\"320\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"28\" rx=\"10\" ry=\"20\" fill=\"#FAF5EE\" transform=\"rotate(0 50 50)\"/>\n      <ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"28\" rx=\"10\" ry=\"20\" fill=\"#FAF5EE\" transform=\"rotate(72 50 50)\"/>\n      <ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"28\" rx=\"10\" ry=\"20\" fill=\"#FAF5EE\" transform=\"rotate(144 50 50)\"/>\n      <ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"28\" rx=\"10\" ry=\"20\" fill=\"#FAF5EE\" transform=\"rotate(216 50 50)\"/>\n      <ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"28\" rx=\"10\" ry=\"20\" fill=\"#FAF5EE\" transform=\"rotate(288 50 50)\"/>\n      <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#FAF5EE\"/>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"wrap\" style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:680px\">\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,52px);color:#FAF5EE;margin:0 0 20px\">Besøk oss i Lofoten</h2>\n    <p style=\"color:rgba(250,245,238,.75);font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:32px\">Vi holder åpent torsdag–søndag kl. 11–16. Velkommen innom for sjokolade, kaffe og en liten stund for deg selv.</p>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:24px\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-accent\" href=\"https://maps.google.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Se kart</a>\n      <a class=\"btn\" style=\"border-color:rgba(250,245,238,.4);color:#FAF5EE\" href=\"/bestill-kake/\">Bestill kake</a>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"color:rgba(250,245,238,.55);font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.04em;margin:0\">Gravdalsgata 15, 8300 Svolvær</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<!-- /wp:html -->",
